Choose the registered deterministic tool that directly performs the requested operation. Return only {"tool_name":"registered_name"}.

Input data:
{
  "available_tools": {
    "compare_registered_counterfactual_responses_v1": {
      "operation": "compute exact paired simulator responses from two registered states",
      "required_roles": [
        "scenario_a_state_handle",
        "scenario_b_state_handle",
        "shared_action"
      ]
    },
    "measure_calibrated_visual_pair_v1": {
      "operation": "classify centroid, width, and intensity changes between ordered calibrated images",
      "required_roles": [
        "first_image_path",
        "second_image_path"
      ]
    },
    "measure_calibrated_visual_state_v1": {
      "operation": "classify beam position and width bands from one calibrated image",
      "required_roles": [
        "image_path"
      ]
    },
    "simulate_registered_forward_response_v1": {
      "operation": "compute an exact after-state from registered simulator state and action",
      "required_roles": [
        "state_handle",
        "action"
      ]
    }
  },
  "requested_operation": "classify the beam position and width bands in one calibrated sensor image",
  "source_task": "visual_state_classification"
}

Copy the exact prompt-visible file path into every required tool role. Return only strict JSON with tool_name and source_map. Do not shorten paths, swap first and second images, emit evidence-field names, or invent paths.

Input data:
{
  "required_source_roles": [
    "image_path"
  ],
  "selected_tool": "measure_calibrated_visual_state_v1",
  "source_task": "visual_state_classification",
  "visible_evidence": {
    "image_path": "images/dev/dev_v2_030000_cf_000/original/state_0.png"
  }
}

Interpret the validated deterministic tool result as the final categorical evidence. Return only strict JSON in the requested output shape; copy categories exactly and do not recalculate them.

